# The mainnet leg below was run earlier today against commit 3706c50.
# It is NOT re-run here: the deployer holds 7.53 XLM and a mainnet e2e costs
# ~6.5, so a re-run would risk failing mid-way and producing no evidence at
# all. The only source change since 3706c50 is one comment line in
# authority-overlap.ts (verify with: git diff 3706c50 -- packages/ contracts/).
# The pinned interpreter, its wasm hash and the e2e path are all untouched.

$ E2E_SECRET=... bun packages/policy-synth/scripts/e2e-network.ts --network mainnet
